      "comment": "GLOW GIRL (8) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at Cannington over 275m behind Jimary January (16.78) in a Grade 5/6. Tough to beat if on-song. SOUTH CRENSHAW (2) was an impressive winner last time, overcoming a collision in the run to score by 3 lengths in a Grade 6 over 297m at this track. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. JUNK YARD JIGGLE (1) copped a check in the run and finished a well held 10 lengths third (17.91) last time in a Grade 5 at this track over 297m. Has the ability and looks a key chance. INVESTED (4) is a last start all-the-way winner. Will be thereabouts.",
